Instructor_Arnold_010_070="[{i Arnold}]: 敌方军队来袭！"
Instructor_Arnold_010_080="[{i Arnold}]: 听从命令！"
Instructor_Arnold_010_090="[{i Arnold}]: 干得好！"
Instructor_Arnold_010_100="[{i Arnold}]: 表现很好！"
